fV0AsRTlARBUIk3VgDSbSsthJg1Ut881IMaQRlw&oe=6ADCD0D4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "RCBrains_Halloween_land.png", "id": "1080044038240349", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_1080044041573682_1224979760121266423_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FJwlI76ZCFQQ7kNvwG-EAXq&_nc_oc=Adq9KFpqf7YiklwZXQhCSglqByW6suY-zTItThRDqxBZrwPHp89Y-S1wvDyB7na196E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO-Z8WtuWqKWt0OCiLxMDqtQI3XSMDiRhlYb7PY--ca4g&oe=6ADCBBEB"}, "display_name": "RC Brains: Halloween Update", "keywords": ["racing", "socialvr", "rccars", "vehicles", "mechs"], "long_description": "# \ud83c\udf83 THE HALLOWEEN UPDATE IS HERE \ud83c\udf83 \n\nRC Brains is a chaotic Social VR playground where you play as a Brain, jump into RC vehicles, and race, fly, crash, explore, and hang out with friends.\n\n**Join the Community=>** https://discord.gg/rcbrains\n \n\n \n# DRIVE RC CARS IN VR\n{3874153959558303}\n\n# PILOT GIANT MECHS\n{28354157054211153}\n\n\nEnter BrainTech City, suit up in a giant mech, and move with your own arms.\n\nClimb, launch, grapple, swing between buildings, and master the city with friends.\n\n# FLY RC DRONES & PLANES IN VR\n{3744554712353768}\n{2225960998146844}\n\n# PILOT GIANT MECHS\n{28354157054211153}\n\n\nEnter BrainTech City, suit up in a giant mech, and move with your own arms.\n\nClimb, launch, grapple, swing between buildings, and master the city with friends.\n\n\n# BECOME THE BRAIN\n{4300031590325704}\n\nJump into RC vehicles, hang out with friends, and create funny moments across the playground.\n\nRace, fly, crash, earn rewards, and become the Brain everyone remembers.\n\n{1526593175742234}\n\n", "short_description": "Play as a Brain in a chaotic Social VR playground! Jump into RC cars, fly RC planes, hang out with friends, earn Brain Bits, and build your RESPECT!"}]}, "developer_name": "AshRift Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": 